abstract: >-
  Reproducibility code for the PIC database study of free thyroxine and
  cystatin C in hospitalized neonates before and after creatinine adjustment.
  PostgreSQL queries extract the cohort, Python performs the statistical
  analyses, and R generates the statistical figures.
